ess `F6` / `Run Current Scene` this will re-run `Node3D2` scene instead run `Node3D` scene.\n\nIf what i said above is wrong, provide a video reproducing the bug to make more clear what's going on.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4231423991/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4231644650","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118388#issuecomment-4231644650","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118388","id":4231644650,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78OcXq","user":{"login":"IDIDIDIO","id":125479629,"node_id":"U_kgDOB3qqzQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125479629?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IDIDIDIO","html_url":"https://github.com/IDIDIDIO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IDIDIDIO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IDIDIDIO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IDIDIDIO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IDIDIDIO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IDIDIDIO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IDIDIDIO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IDIDIDIO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IDIDIDIO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IDIDIDIO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-12T13:56:04Z","updated_at":"2026-04-12T13:56:29Z","body":"you were entirely correct\non subsequent closes the debug would minimize and i thought that it was crashing entirely \n(noticed that it was actually minimizing while watching my recording of it)\n